  {
    "id": 7902001060010,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "やはりここまで来ると、\r\n乗り越えるべき壁も高かったな……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/701300106/7902001060010"
  },
  {
    "id": 7901001060010,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "結果は残念でしたけど……\r\nおふたりは立派にやってましたよ！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/701300106/7901001060010"
  },
  {
    "id": 7901001060020,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "ここまで来れただけでも、\r\n胸を張って誇れることだと私は思います",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/701300106/7901001060020"
  },
  {
    "id": 7902001060020,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "ああ、良い活躍だった\r\nそれはたしかだ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/701300106/7902001060020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……俺もそう思います\r\n彼女はよくやってくれました",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7901001060030,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "その言葉を、彼女に直接\r\n言ってあげましょう？",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/701300106/7901001060030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……はい",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
