    "waitType": "effect"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……すまない\r\n三次審査は通らなかった",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7013001060010,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "……っ！\r\n…………",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701300106/7013001060010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……な、夏葉、大丈夫か？　『W.I.N.G.』のことは\r\n残念だけど、夏葉はまだまだ――",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7013001060020,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "プロデューサー、今の私には何が足りなかったのかしら",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701300106/7013001060020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……今は何も気にしなくていいぞ\r\n夏葉は誰にも負けないくらい頑張ってたからな",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7013001060030,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "大丈夫よ、本当のことを言って\r\n決して落ち込んでいるわけじゃないの",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701300106/7013001060030"
  },
  {
    "id": 7013001060040,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "審査を突破できなかったのは悲しいけど、\r\n結果が全てを物語ってるって、理解してるつもりよ",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701300106/7013001060040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "分かった。事務所に戻ってしっかり反省をしよう",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7013001060050,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "ありがとう、プロデューサー",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701300106/7013001060050"
  },
  {
    "id": 7013001060060,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "こんなところで私、諦めたくないわ！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701300106/7013001060060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（強い心だ……夏葉ならまだまだ成長できる！）",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "わかった。夏葉の良さをもっと生かせるように\r\n今後をしっかり考えて行こう！",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "明日からトレーニングが厳しくなるぞ！",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7013001060070,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "構わないわ！　プロデューサー",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701300106/7013001060070"
  },
  {
    "id": 7013001060080,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "世界一のアイドルを目指すのに必要な事なら\r\n私はどんなことでもこなして見せるわ！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701300106/7013001060080"
